<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Experimental Details ‣ Aligning Inductive Bias for Data-Efficient Generalization in State Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Optimization of the SSM Parameters</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Experimental Details ‣ Aligning Inductive Bias for Data-Efficient Generalization in State Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Design of Low- and High-Frequency Biased SSMs</span></a></li>
