<p id="A4.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Batch size = 50 for small training sets (ratio <math id="A4.I1.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;0.2</annotation></semantics></math>), 70 for larger training sets (ratio <math id="A4.I1.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;0.2</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div></li>
